<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi forces have moved additional troops into Basra to prevent possible Iran-backed attacks on Kuwait. Erbil airport is reopening to European airlines as international flights gradually resume. Baghdad and Erbil have agreed to allow Nineveh villagers to return, while protesters in Kirkuk blocked the Erbil highway over generator fees. Australians are being held in Iraq on alleged ISIS links and could face the death penalty, and a blast hit the British embassy in Baghdad. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQb21uWkV3VUN1NFZXSVlLbUNQaVhsV2MtaXRNbDctWjVuRndzY1c2Y19EWV9zV2Z3VjNReEFXWHJjS1FtYnpFRFRQWlNqWmk5Y2hRZGtqYlpnOThjc21NdE96MkpXcHFsMnExb1FKY0VkSV8yaXJQZHhuRFBkWFk3YmR4Z3h1QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPUDBMYVBUMDhEcnNvY2RDNHRZUXFTT0xOYzcxZTZiNUVucG5TWlgtekhwLWhwSTBxSDZXXzFjU2licDg4eWF5TV9jcDdRclRxeWtWR1NkZE9sZVl1VHNwNzJ6V2xucUc1TGRJamQycWJSNUZKRGFCQUh4VUxiVXBELTJJSXJ3NFBFVUhhV2pDSTNPMjE1QlJEM3N0amR2aExMUlpRUUIzUkM3S3VkR3pUZTdWbjBrM1EyTlg3NS1jUUg3UmJ3eWVfMzdrZ3M?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiQkFVX3lxTE5BYkxMeEpiaTlkRGRiblNpY1ItTV9LWU5RZHRibHU3ajV1elNralcwTC15VmZTWTBoWC1nZElENFNjZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;الحرة&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxQRW1hOFZxNGI5ZW9YdGFMZEZOZlRLZjdlUzcyd1ZPZ3BydHoxQl9POWRwcHl3Vloxd3dWZUVBU19NWV9PSU9faGRoY1ZtLVpFMXUyMkRQZXR3eU12c25oRl9VRlJOMWplbThFc20tQUJyZE9Oc1MwR2dEdnhBOFlpVk9EQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQNzRPMzFkRFdxNnNSRTdsRzlSQ0l2RmxlRFlIOWpSaldkUC1USlBSUk1RTHBwaTQxdkxSYTFVRFhaUXVuMTlEMTNid3RTYUc1ckc5UExNR19wcVFuTjlYOWlBUW